    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead World is a first-person action game that immerses you in a post-apocalyptic world in a devastated Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 1: THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Miguel receives a job that will take him to Rosario to see what happened to a wagon that was supposed to arrive at the Entre R\u00edos settlement of San Diego. But what was supposed to be a short trip turns into a struggle to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 2: GINO'S JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the volcanic dunes of La Payunia... in a Renault 12.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a post-apocalyptic world where life has almost disappeared, Gino, a schnauzer from Mendoza, is the last of his kind. But everything changes when he learns that a female of his breed has been spotted in a distant settlement. Daniel and Manuel embark on a desperate journey through the dead world aboard their trusty Renault 12, facing mutants, hostile gangs, and whatever else crosses their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead World is a first-person action game that immerses you in a post-apocalyptic world in a devastated Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 1: THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Miguel receives a job that will take him to Rosario to see what happened to a wagon that was supposed to arrive at the Entre R\u00edos settlement of San Diego. But what was supposed to be a short trip turns into a struggle to get back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 2: GINO'S JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through the volcanic dunes of La Payunia... in a Renault 12.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a post-apocalyptic world where life has almost disappeared, Gino, a schnauzer from Mendoza, is the last of his kind. But everything changes when he learns that a female of his breed has been spotted in a distant settlement. Daniel and Manuel embark on a desperate journey through the dead world aboard their trusty Renault 12, facing mutants, hostile gangs, and whatever else crosses their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dead World is a first-person action game set in a post-apocalyptic world, where you follow the journey of several characters through a war-torn Argentina.",
